Comment: The Files: vendor/... paragraphs below cover the crates in the orig component tarball
 qsh_VERSION.orig-vendor.tar.xz (`cargo vendor --locked --versioned-dirs`), present only in
 builds with the pkg.qsh.vendored profile. They are generated from Cargo.lock by
 packaging/ci/debian-copyright.py in the upstream repository; review them on every update.

